<title>INDIA: India ITC Hotels up 8 pct before results.</title>
<headline>India ITC Hotels up 8 pct before results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of ITC Hotels climbed nine rupees, or 7.8 percent, to 124 in early trade on the Bombay bourse on Wednesday ahead of the firm's results for the year ended March, traders said.</p>
<p>A hotels analyst at a leading securities firm said the market was expecting a net profit of around 320 million to 350 million rupees, up from 265 million in 1995/96 (April-March).</p>
<p>But some analysts said the net could come in slightly below expectations due to a slowdown in business and leisure travel in the second half of the fiscal year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
